WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:11.940
29 invoices. 4 currencies. 1 person reviewing them by hand. 3 should not be paid. 11 need an approval. Which ones?

2
00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:22.320
Thesaurus knows in seconds. And explains why. The accounts payable agent that decides with your rules.

3
00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:39.258
It receives every invoice, by portal, PDF or email. And AI reads it: payee, amount, currency, account and dates, with its confidence level.

4
00:00:39.808 --> 00:00:45.376
Code checks 13 rules, with the day's exchange rate.

5
00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:52.566
And it decides: PAY, STOP or ESCALATE. PAY is only written when all 13 pass.

6
00:00:53.116 --> 00:01:00.168
If something falls outside the rules, it asks a concrete question. A person approves in one click.

7
00:01:00.718 --> 00:01:05.590
Every decision keeps its record. And you can ask it.

8
00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:11.124
AI reads. Code decides. A person approves.

9
00:01:11.674 --> 00:01:17.146
29 sample invoices. 0 payments outside the rules.

10
00:01:17.696 --> 00:01:24.400
In production: the inbox shows what gets paid, what awaits approval and the agent's autonomy.

11
00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:31.966
When an invoice exceeds the threshold, the question is concrete and the answer is one click.

12
00:01:32.516 --> 00:01:38.944
And vendors send their invoices from their own portal, also from a phone.

13
00:01:39.494 --> 00:01:45.782
Thesaurus. Ready to connect to Blinka. Try it today with your own company.
